    "description": {
      "value": "<p><em>Level 5 Bastion Facility</em></p><p><strong>Prerequisite:</strong> None<br /><strong>Space:</strong> Roomy<br /><strong>Hirelings:</strong> 1<br /><strong>Order:</strong> Trade</p><p>A cool, dark space for trade goods and other objects.</p><p><strong>Trade: Goods.</strong> For 7 days, the hireling either buys nonmagical items worth up to 500 GP in total and stores them here, or sells goods stored here. You pay for purchases; the maximum value rises to 2,000 GP at level 9 and 5,000 GP at level 13. When you sell goods from your Storehouse, the buyer pays 10 percent more than the standard price (20 percent at level 9, 50 percent at level 13, 100 percent at level 17).</p>",
